{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1386587-harbingers-of-skulls-questions","id":1386587,"title":"Harbingers of skulls questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-07T18:47:47-07:00","id":1386587,"title":"Harbingers of skulls questions","content":"I have a few questions on elements of the harbingers of skulls that i am confused by or don't fully understand.<br /> I would appreciate it if anyone could answer these questions.<br /> 1. On the white wolf wiki its mentioned that the Sabbat harbingers were a cabal of 50 ancient and powerful cappaodocians, what source is this specific number stated in?<br /> 2. Are the Sabbat Harbingers, Cappadocians who were imprisoned in kaymakli during the feast of folly, or were they the ones who decided to go into kaymakli after the feast of Folly, during the giovanni purge(once again source is appreciated if possible)?<br /> 3. Have any of the sabbat harbingers embraced or is it just the Tal'meh'rah harbingers who embrace?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26129-harbinger1999","name":"Harbinger1999","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T20:55:01-07:00","id":1386606,"title":"","content":"Just from context, I believe that the Harbingers' numbers were deliberately stated as being low because they were too ancient and too low-generation to be intended for use as player characters. Their arrival was meant to just be a metaplot event that created the feeling that things were escalating, and some karmic debts from the Dark Ages were about to come due.<br /> <br /> The Harbingers' identities were deliberately kept mysterious, but it was always my assumption that they were some of the original victims of the Feast of Folly, the ones strong enough in their command of Necromancy to escape to the Underworld and hide until they were ready.<br /> <br /> I don't know of any Sabbat Harbingers who embraced new vampires in canon.<br /> <br /> Note that the Tal'mahe'ra had been exterminated by the same incident that triggered the Sixth Maelstrom in Vampire's Revised Edition, which was when the Harbingers were introduced. The Harbingers weren't in the original book on the Tal'mahe'ra because the game's writers had not made them up yet! It's in the more setting-neutral V20 that characters like the Tal'mahe'ra Harbingers become plausible, because the option to have the Tal'mahe'ra survive is supported.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11599,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","user":"Reasor","date":". 05-08-2020, 02:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T06:14:43-07:00","id":1386667,"title":"","content":"The Harbingers' true origins are laid out across V20 Guide to the Tal'Mahe'Ra, V20 Lore of the Bloodlines, V20 Tome of Secrets, and V20 Beckett's Jyhad Diary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T08:29:29-07:00","id":1386701,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar152_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"152\" data-vbnamecard=\"152\">The Gentleman Gamer</a> thanks for responding to my post, love your videos. Anyway, i've read some of the sources provided on that list, and they do answer 2 of my questions but i still cant find a source as to the harbingers having been a cabal of 50 Cappadocians, would this have been something that the wikia made up or is there a specific page this is mentioned on in one of those book?<br /> (once again thanks for providing those books as sources for their origins).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26129-harbinger1999","name":"Harbinger1999","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26129_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T13:39:01-07:00","i